section: codegen
synopsis: Fix the control flow graph tracking of the x86 native code generator
  for word-to-float conversions, 64-bit shifts on i386, other operations that
  introduce basic blocks, and for the stack allocation blocks inserted by the
  register allocator. This fixes a panic ("Can't find weight for edge that
  should have one") and improves code layout. The CFG is now also used
  for code layout and dead code elimination on i386.
